        "html": "<p><span style=\"letter-spacing:normal\">Removing two derelict weirs took three years of permits and nine days of work. Salmon were counted upstream within a season — the first recorded there since 1974. The channel is already re-cutting its own bends, which is the part no restoration plan can draw.</span></p>"
